  "title": "Daktronics to Host Investor Day on April 9, 2026, in New York City",
  "summary": "Daktronics (NASDAQ: DAKT) of Brookings, South Dakota, the leading U.S.-based designer and manufacturer of best-in-class dynamic video communication displays and control systems for customers worldwide, today announced it will host its 2026 Investor Day on Thursday, April 9, at the home of the NASDAQ MarketSite in Times Square.",
